# No em dash (—)

Never use the Unicode em dash character `—` (U+2014) anywhere in this project: UI copy, alt text, metadata, comments, docs, seeds, or commits.

Prefer:
- Sentence break: period (`.`) or semicolon (`;`)
- Label / subtitle: colon (`:`) or comma (`,`)
- Empty table cells: hyphen-minus (`-`)
- Numeric ranges: en dash is also discouraged; use `09:00-18:00` or `1-2` with hyphen-minus

Do not "fix" prose by inserting em dashes.
